== Mechanics ==
=== HUD ===
; Found HUD
* Found HUD is a HUD addition that appears on the left side of the screen that gives numerical values to the player's current stats (e.g., damage, luck, speed, devil room chance). It can be enabled through the options menu.
* It is based on the Missing HUD mod for Rebirth and Afterbirth.

=== Victory Lap ===
* A Victory Lap allows you to start a new run with almost all of your final items after completing the [[Dark Room]]. Multiple laps can be made as long as the Dark Room is cleared each time.
** [[Completion Mark]]s and most [[achievement]]s cannot be earned.
** Isaac will take a full heart of damage on all floors after beginning a victory lap (unless he has [[The Wafer]]).
** Some [[item]]s are lost upon starting a victory lap. Items lost this way are added back into their respective item pools and can be acquired again.
** If the initial run was on normal difficulty, all victory laps will be on hard difficulty.
** On the third and subsequent victory laps, the character will turn into [[The Lost]]. This version of The Lost does not get a [[Holy Mantle]] or [[D4]].  However, if the run was started as The Lost (or if the Holy Mantle was found) it is possible to keep the Holy Mantle from the previous run.
** On the third and subsequent victory laps, [[Shop]]s will no longer appear.
** On the third and subsequent victory laps, [[Red Chest]]s in the [[Dark Room]] will turn into [[Chest]]s and [[Locked Chest]]s.
** Killing any final boss aside from [[The Lamb]] will end the game, and the run will not be continued further.

== Menus ==
=== Options ===
; Charge bars
* Added a new "charge bars" option in the menu, for passive items that need to be charged up before usage.
* This includes:
** {{i|Brimstone}} (collectible and Azazel)
** {{i|Chocolate Milk}}
** {{i|Cursed Eye}}
** {{i|Lil Brimstone}}
** {{i|Lil Delirium}}
** {{i|Lil Gurdy}}
** {{i|Lil Monstro}}
** {{i|Maw Of The Void}}
** {{i|Mom's Knife}}
** {{i|Monstro's Lung}}
** {{i|Tech X}}
** Bone Club ([[The Forgotten]]'s throwable weapon)

; [[RERUN]]
* RERUN is unlocked after completing the RERUN [[achievement]].
* After winning a run the ''Continue'' option in the main menu will be replaced by ''Rerun''. Selecting it starts a new run using most of the previous won run's items. Isaac will take full heart damage on all floors.

