=== Chests ===
; [[file:Mimic Chest.png|link=Mimic Chest]] [[Mimic Chest]]s
* Mimic Chests appear similar to Brown Chests until Isaac moves near, at which point they sprout spikes that damage the player as a Spike Chest would. They can be distinguished from Brown Chests by their darker, purplish-brown coloring, the grayish spot on each side of the latch where the spikes will sprout from and the bloodstain.

