=== Obstacles ===
; [[File:Super Special Rocks.png|link=Super special rock]] [[Super special rock]]
* Super special rocks are tinted rock variants which are much harder to spot, as they have a smaller mark and are not discolored. Super special rocks takes two bombs to blow up, and drop the contents of two tinted rocks.
; [[File:White Poop.png|link=White poop]] [[White poop]]
* White poop is surrounded by an aura that halves tear delay and has a high chance to block damage like the {{i|Cone Head}} item while Isaac stands within it. The aura disappears if the poop is destroyed.
; [[File:Dirt Patch.png|link=Dirt Patch]][[File:Dirt Patch Forgotten.png|link=Dirt Patch]] [[Dirt Patch]]
* Dirt Patches are a small mound of dirt that can be dug into with certain items. Using {{i|Mom's Shovel}} on top of a Dirt Patch will reveal a skeleton and unlock [[The Forgotten]]. Once The Forgotten is unlocked, using Mom's Shovel, {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}}, or {{p|Ehwaz}} on top of a Dirt Patch will dig up a random [[chest]].

=== Machines ===
; [[File:Mom's Dressing Table.png|link=]] [[Mom's Dressing Table]]
* It appears in the starting room of a floor if Isaac has 8 or more items.
* If Isaac bumps into Mom's Dressing Table, his appearance will be randomly changed so that only a few of his items are displayed.
* Hitting Mom's Dressing Table with an explosive will cause it to vanish and drop 1-4 pills. There is a 1% chance to spawn one of the following items instead: [[Mom's Underwear]], [[Mom's Heels]], [[Mom's Lipstick]], [[Mom's Bra]], [[Mom's Pad]], [[Mom's Eyeshadow]], [[Mom's Contacts]], [[Mom's Wig]], [[Mom's Perfume]] or [[Mom's Pearls]].

